acceptance_criteria: Summary counts are workspace-scoped or the slice-scoped fields are renamed to say so with the workspace count beside them; The orient and handoff intents carry both scopes explicitly and the omission receipt names summary as population-scoped; A negative control that renders a slice count under a population key fails; The truthful-context contract doc and the context intent fixtures record the field semantics
