repro_steps: "Run pm context --json, pm context --limit 3 --json, and pm context --for orient --json on a tracker with more open items than the limit and compare summary.open with pm stats by_status.open"
expected_result: Summary counts describe the workspace or are named as slice counts beside the workspace figure
actual_result: "summary.open is 53, 4, and 4 for the same 291-open workspace and the orient block prints workspace totals beside slice counts"
